WEBVTT

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:08.660
A message!

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:08.910
"Kitty Zhang"
"Even though it was snack day :,-("

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.660
"Kitty Zhang"
"Even though it was snack day :,-("

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.660
Let's see...

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:16.660
"Today was the one day a month I'm allowed
to eat snacks. But the cake I've been wanting
to eat since last month just had to be sold out.
I can't believe it!"

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.660
"...no, that's not it.
It's saying I should save the best for last.
It's a sign that good things are coming."

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.700
"Good things are coming"?

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:27.410
"After the world championships
next month, I'll go visit you.
I'll show you my gold medal, too."

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.700
Kitty... Zhang...?

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.080
Yeah, yeah! You met her during
the training camp, remember?

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.160
She said she's coming to visit!

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.620
Hm...?

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:46.410
Rachel, you made a friend?
I want to meet her, too, indeed!

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:50.160
Okay, okay. Make sure you greet her properly!

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:55.200
Dad, it's summer vacation,
so can Kitty stay with us?

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.500
Sure. I'm glad you made a friend.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.700
Yeah!

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.950
Bigbird, make sure you behave, too!

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.410
If you act weird, you're going
back to South America!

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:05.870
Me?

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:10.290
BB, let us both work hard
to not be careless, indeed!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.660
Dad, work hard on your special training, too.

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:16.410
Yeah...

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:20.750
I... don't think I can go
any further than this...

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:51.870
"The Gymnastics Samurai"

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:05.080
Your triple is stable.
Your timing's getting better, too.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.910
You're almost there.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.410
I think I've almost got it.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:14.540
Once you complete this move,
it'll be named the Aragaki.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.910
Don't lose focus.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:20.500
Is something the matter?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:25.250
Once I've mastered the triple...
will a quadruple be possible, too?

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:30.750
Huh? Don't talk about stuff like that
until you can at least grab the bar.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.580
You're right.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.200
That's enough for today.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.500
Yes, sir.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:42.790
Well, if by some remote chance
you do ever end up doing a quadruple,

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:46.410
it'd be impossible to do it as a release
move like what you're trying now.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:51.040
It'd probably end up being a dismount--
where you do four turns and land.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:54.620
A quadruple... dismount.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:07.700
His body opens up after three turns, huh?

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:11.790
He still can't visualize
finishing four full turns...

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.620
You haven't really gotten the hang of it yet?

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:15.330
No, not yet...

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:19.700
Let's stop here for today
and check your form in the video.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.080
Yes, sir.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:23.620
Leo!

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:27.620
I need to talk to Amakusa today,
too, so you can go home first.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:28.660
Joe!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.080
Hm?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.830
Can I go with you?

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:37.910
I want to work hard and help
with something, too, indeed!

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:43.250
Is it all right?

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:44.700
Sure.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.790
I am in your debt!

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:51.620
Here.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:55.790
You've got the height, but you lose your
form at the end of the third rotation.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:00.450
I jump and do one turn,
keep going to finish three...

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.500
...and then four.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:07.500
I just can't seem to visualize
the fourth turn...

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:11.200
Well, I already took into consideration
that you'd hit a wall.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:16.370
In the first place, trying to do four turns
in an official competition isn't normal.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:20.250
You're doing something that
not even Liu Longxiang is trying.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.450
Keep persevering steadily
to find a breakthrough.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:24.410
Yes, sir.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:25.500
Oh!

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:28.000
A spiral, indeed!

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.200
Huh?

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.410
Go right through the middle of the spinning!

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:36.080
Become a ninja star! A pinwheel!

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.290
Huh?

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.080
Pinwheel...

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.330
Do you get it?

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.290
No.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.910
It's no good, huh?

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:47.160
I'll think harder, indeed!

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.750
Thanks.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:52.910
"Intensive Training Samurai"

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:28.120
Joe, you're back, indeed.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.250
Have you done ballet for a long time?

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:35.660
Right now, I'm a ninja who can do ballet.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.660
I see.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:42.950
I'm still in training, indeed!
I'm working hard every day!

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:47.450
Oh, is it time to go home?
Rachel's waiting for us, huh?

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:51.700
When no one's using it...
you can dance here as much as you want.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.250
I am in your debt...

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.500
Rei!

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.040
Hello, Kitty!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.370
How've you been?

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:43.370
Good!

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:47.040
We're always e-mailing each other,
so it doesn't feel like it's been a long time.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.790
Look, just like I said.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:55.830
I saw it on TV! It was amazing! Congrats!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:08:00.950
Oh, Kitty, where's your luggage?
You don't have much with you.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.540
I sent it to your house first.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:07.450
I see! Then, Dad's probably getting it now.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.870
There's a lot.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.830
Kitty, where do you want to go first?

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:19.540
I've already decided. Follow me.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.910
What, we're going in here?

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:27.950
Yeah. Rei, you don't like clothes?

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:33.080
That's not it, but this place
looks really expensive...

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:37.120
Don't worry about it.
I just want to give you a present.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.200
What?! Present?!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:42.160
Yeah! Come on already.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.750
This... and this.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.450
This...

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:49.620
...and this, too!

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.330
And this.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.410
Please.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:54.700
One moment please.

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:57.750
Rei.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.750
Hurry up and come here.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.120
Right.

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.750
I changed, but...

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.660
Show me!

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.450
It's so cute!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.040
Okay, next.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.290
Huh?

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.370
Look in the mirror.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:39.540
Clothes like this look really good on you.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:41.200
When you wear new clothes,

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:44.080
don't you feel like you've found a "you"
that you didn't know before?

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:30.080
Three, two, one...!

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:34.000
"Kitty"                               "Rei"
"I'm here~!! Love ya"

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.870
Aragaki...! World class...

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.620
Kazu?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:51.160
Oh, my! You've got friends that cute?

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:54.250
Go talk to them. I'll wait here.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.290
Huh?!

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.870
No way, no way... I can't.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:03.410
If you act like that, girls won't like you.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:15.790
You can't help but look, huh?
His last jump turn was also really stable.

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:17.830
It's a pinwheel, indeed!

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:19.290
Pinwheel...

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.540
That's the part I don't get.

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.790
A pinwheel is...

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:30.290
It's like, whoosh and whoa,
squeeze and pop, indeed!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.830
Whoosh... and whoa?

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:36.120
I get it even less now. Is that what you're
imagining when you're trying to turn?

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:40.290
Huh? I'm not trying to turn, indeed.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.200
You're not trying to turn?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:45.370
My body just moves on its own...

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:51.580
Oh! I feel like I want to jump higher, indeed!
It's fun when you jump high!

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:54.950
Well, it's important to have fun.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.000
Not trying to turn...

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.370
What's the matter?

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:03.580
Don't try to turn, whoosh and
whoa, squeeze and pop...

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.330
I see.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.000
Have fun with the squeeze and pop, right?

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.830
That's it, indeed, Joe!

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.290
Squeeze? Pop?

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:29.040
Kitty's a really good singer.
She could be a pro!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.040
And she's a gold medalist, right?

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.330
Yeah!

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:36.580
She's fashionable, too, and really decisive.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.040
She's amazing!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:42.580
She's really got guts. Like, totally worldly.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:44.450
Yeah, yeah! She's so cool.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:48.250
She'd be a good warrior. Like,
you could trust her to have your back.

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:49.410
Wall?

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.410
I'm talking about the Hoover Mission.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.870
♪ Oh, pink... ♪

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:06.950
Who in the world is she? She caught
the maraca without even looking.

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:10.830
Her character profile is a mercenary
who's traveled all over the world.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.620
"Character profile"?

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:16.620
Kitty, let's sing together next!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:27.620
Ikebukuro's a fun place!
There are all sorts of people here.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.200
Right?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.620
Let's play a lot tomorrow, too!

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.250
Yeah!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.410
We're home, indeed!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.750
What're you looking at?

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.580
Bigbird, that's rude!

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:42.450
He's got a weird face!

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:44.290
Rachel?

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:45.790
Oh, welcome back!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.160
"Rachel"?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:52.540
Rachel! Those clothes look so good on you!
You look like a Hollywood actress!

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:54.750
You're overreacting!

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:56.500
More importantly--

00:13:56.500 --> 00:14:01.910
Hi! I'm Kitty Zhang. You can call
me "Kitty." I'm a friend of Rei's.

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:03.790
Thanks for letting me come, Samurai.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:08.120
Hello, Kitty... Zhang.
Thanks for coming to visit Rei.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:11.080
I'm the ninja of the Aragaki family, indeed!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.120
Ninja?

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.000
I'm a ninja, indeed!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.290
Oh? Well, nice to meet you.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.830
Thanks for helping even though you're a guest.

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:28.160
It's faster with two people, right? It's fine.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.080
♪ Indeed ♪

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:32.620
♪ Indeed, I'm a ninja, indeed ♪

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:40.290
Oh! Ninja, are you Leonardo Sturges?!

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:43.540
Why's the pride of Royal in a place like this?

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:48.500
Hm? Wait, weren't you taking
a break because of illness?

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:52.250
I... I'll slip away from here first.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.080
Huh?

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.540
"The pride of Royal"?

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.790
Wow, it's true.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.160
"The Young Pride of Royal
Takes Mysterious Extended Break?"

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:06.540
"The Young Pride of Royal
Takes Mysterious Extended Break?"

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:06.540
Leo's a ballet dancer... He's someone amazing!

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:09.200
But I wonder why he didn't say anything...

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:13.160
He's probably not sick, either.
He's so energetic.

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:17.370
Why is he here in the first place?

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:23.120
Um... He followed us home from
this place called Edo Wonderland.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.750
Apparently, he really likes Dad's gymnastics.

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:29.370
It didn't seem like he had anywhere else to go,
so he ended up staying with us...

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:31.790
Besides, I like ninjas!

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:32.910
Ninjas?

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.330
Leo was a ninja at Edo Wonderland!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:38.790
He might be more ninja-like
than ninja now, though.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:44.370
But ever since Leo came, every day's been fun.

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.750
Oh?

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.200
Kitty, what are some things you like?

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:53.450
Me? Right now it's gymnastics.
And singing, I guess.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.620
Singing?

00:15:54.620 --> 00:16:00.000
I decided that if I get a gold medal
at the next Olympics, I'll become an idol.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.660
What about gymnastics?
You can still do it for a while, can't you?

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:06.160
I love gymnastics. It's really fun.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:10.620
But it's not the only thing I like.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:15.950
I'll become an idol and
make my name as a superstar!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.830
"Superstar"...?

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:22.410
"The way of the ninja is
to fight with your all to live!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:26.580
Only if you are prepared to die
is there a path to life!"

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:29.540
<i>Ooku vs. Kunoichi</i>...!

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:35.700
I learned from Tomoyo that you
need to make your own future.

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:39.410
If I think about things that way,
then the future is filled with hope.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:43.120
You only live once, so the ones
who have the most fun win, right?

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:47.040
I want to do anything as long as it seems fun.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:50.500
Maybe in ten years, I'll be on Mars!

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.830
The world is really big, you know.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.450
What's your dream, Rei?

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.330
Huh?! Um...

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.620
I haven't thought about it yet.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:07.870
Right now, I guess I want to cheer Dad on...

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.870
I see.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:15.790
When I was around your age,
I wanted a gold medal in gymnastics.

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.000
What about you, Rei?

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:22.000
The things you like, the things you enjoy--
What do you want to try doing?

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.700
I think I have fun when
I'm playing movie pretend...

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.120
What's that?

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.040
I do it all the time with Leo!

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:45.000
We reenact famous scenes from the movies
we like, pretending to be the characters!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:48.950
Oh, that's why he calls you "Rachel."
That sounds fun!

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.080
But is Leo really that good at acting?

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:53.790
Leo just acts like Leo.

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:57.040
What? I'll definitely be better than him, then.

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.910
I want to try it tomorrow!

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:01.500
What movie should we do...?

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.540
The way of the ninja is
to fight with your all to live!

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:56.290
Only if you are prepared to die
is there a path to life!

00:18:56.290 --> 00:19:00.200
Knowing your weakness is like having
an unmoving blade in your heart,

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:02.410
opening the path of the ninja!

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.790
This predicament we find ourselves in

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:09.700
is an opportunity to acquire a steadfast heart,
without fear, contempt, or worry!

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:12.620
Those with the fortitude to bring about peace--

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:15.410
If you want to become true ninjas...

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:20.370
...then stand together with me now!

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:24.120
"The fight of the woman
hidden in the annals of history"

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:36.200
Rei, it was a really fun summer vacation!

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.160
Thank you.

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:39.080
Sure!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:41.370
I'll e-mail you. Later!

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.540
Kitty!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.700
I...

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.910
...want to become a famous actress!

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:07.500
I love movies.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:11.000
It's so fun watching them
and pretending to be in them.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.370
That's all it was up until now.

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:18.910
But spending time with you, and seeing
how you value the things you like...

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:23.750
Making your dreams come true even though
you'd never done them before...

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.750
I thought it was amazing!
I want to find more things that I like.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.870
I want to try doing more and more fun things.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:35.120
I want to study acting properly, too!

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:37.160
You found it, huh?

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:42.540
I'm looking forward to it.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:43.910
Yeah!

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:53.870
Samurai, do your best for Rei's sake.

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:55.120
I will.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:58.910
How long will you hide as a ninja?

